   "text": "Keeping kids entertained can be a challenge in any city.\nOur girls were gripped by the promise of dolphins in Tampa Bay on an early morning boat ride with Dolphin Landings on St Pete Beach. Our captain, Susi, was from Yorkshire. She explained that she had come to St Pete with her dad for a holiday 28 years ago and never went back home. It was easy to see why as we floated the sunshine amid the cal",
